        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Magele ga bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni shaalī shigabanhyiwe mu magele gīt'ūmo baalī a bitūnja bakwe: Nadabu, Abihu, Eleaza, na Itamaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Nadabu nū Abihu bakatonga ū kūzumalīka, būneka ū saabo ataalī mpanga, batalekile bitūnja. Na lūūlū ū nīmo gwa būgabīji gūbiza gwa ng'wa Eleaza na Itamaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho alībatūūla a bagabīji mu magele gabo ga būtūmami, akagunanhwa na Sadoki ūyo walī wa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Eleaza, hamò na Ahimeleki ūyo walī wa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wigele lya shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Eleaza baalīmo batongeeji bingī, kūtinda ū ng'wigele lya shibyalīīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali; na lūūlū bakagabanhyiwa kūlenganīla nū wingī wabo: ndūgū ikūmi n'itandatū ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Eleaza, ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali ndūgū inaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabiza na witegeleja ū mu kūbagabanhya; būtūmamīla mbale, nguno ū mu magele būbīlī wago, ī lya shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Eleaza nī lya shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali, balīmo banhū bigeleelilwe kūtūmama ū ng'wipandī lyeela, nū kūgwīta ū nīmo gwa ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shemaya ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Nesaneeli, ūmò wa Balawī, walī ng'wandīki; h'ūyo akagandīka a mina gabo kū būtongi wa ntemi na bagunanhi bakwe. Nū ngabīji Sadoki walīho, na Ahimeleki ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Abiasali, hamò na a bataale ba ndūgū ja bagabīji nī ja Balawī; kaya īmò yūsolwa kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Eleaza, na kaaya īmò kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Itamaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbale ya kwandya īkangwīla Yehoyalibu, ī ya kabīlī yūngwīla Yedaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya kadatū yūngwīla Hilamu, ya kanè yūngwīla Seolimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya katanò yūngwīla Malikiya, ya katandatū yūngwīla Mijamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya mpungatī yūngwīla Hakozi, ya kanaane yūngwīla Abiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya kenda yūngwīla Yeshua, y'ikūmi yūngwīla Shekania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'ikūmi na īmò yūngwīla Eliyashibu, y'ikūmi n'ibīlī yūngwīla Yakimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'ikūmi n'idatū yūngwīla Hupa, y'ikūmi n'inè yūngwīla Yeshebeamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'ikūmi n'itanò yūngwīla Biliga, y'ikūmi n'itandatū yūngwīla Ima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'ikūmi na mpungatī yūngwīla Hezili, y'ikūmi n'inaane yūngwīla Hapizeezi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'ikūmi na kenda yūngwīla Petahiya, ya makūmi abīlī yūngwīla Yehezikeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya makūmi abīlī n'īmò yūng'wīla Yakini, ya makūmi abīlī n'ibīlī yūng'wīla Gamulī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya makūmi abīlī n'idatū yūng'wīla Delaiya, ya makūmi abīlī n'inè yūngwīla Maaziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A genaya h'a magele gabo gīt'ūmo baalī bahelelilwe, kūlwa kūja kūtūmama mu hekalu ya ng'wa Seeba. H'ūmo shaalī ī shīīmīle īsho baalī bahelelwa nū ntaale wabo ū Alooni, gītūūmo walī wanagīīlīla ū Seeba, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balawī bangī hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīmo na bangī ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Lawī: ū kūfuma ū mu numba ya ng'wa Amulamu: Shubaeli; ū kūfuma ū mu numba ya ng'wa Shubaeli: Yehideya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba numba ya ng'wa Lehabiya, ū wa kwandya kūbyalwa ū mu bitūnja bakwe walī Ishiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu numba ya ng'wa Iziha, Shelomoti; ū mu bitūnja ba ng'wa Shelomoti; Yahati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Hebuloni, ū ntaale wabo walī Yelia, ū wa kabīlī Amalia, ū wa kadatū Yahazieli, ū wa kanè Yekameamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Uzieli walī Mika; ū kūfuma ū mu bitūnja ba ng'wa Mika; Shamili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu bana ba ng'wawe ba ng'wa Mika Ishiya; ū kūfuma ū mu bitūnja ba ng'wa Ishiya, Zakalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū bitūnja ba ng'wa Melali: Mahili na Mushi. Ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yaazia walī Beno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Melali: kūfuma mulī Yaazia; Beno, Shohamu, Zaaku na Ibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mulī Mahili; Eleaza: ū ng'wene atabyalile bitūnja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mulī Kishi: ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Kisha walī Yelahimeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Mushi baalī: Mahili, Edina na Yelimoti. A benaba baalī Balawī kūlondeela ūmo jalī ī ndūgū jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bakatūlīkīja ī mbale gīt'ūmo bakīītīla a bana ba ng'wabo, a ba shibyalīīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni; ū kū būtongi wa ng'wa ntemi Daūdi, nū Sadoki, Ahimeleki, na a bataale ba ndūgū ja bagabīji nī ja Balawī. Walī būtīīho būsolaanhyiwa; īyo jītīlagwa ī kaya ja ntaale hū ūmo jītīlagwa nī kaaya ī ja ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.31"
            ]
          }
